he war. See Paul Revere House, the Old North Church, and the Bunker Hill Monument, all must-see sites for history lovers. Discover attractions not seen by most tourists like the Church of the Covenant, a house of worship that has stunning stained-glass windows made by Tiffany. \n\nOr visit the North End, home to Little Italy with numerous Italian restaurants, pastry shops, and delis. This area has some of the oldest buildings in the city. Newbury Street is a bustling district filled with19th-century brownstones that house restaurants, retail stores, and a vibrant entertainment district for a fun night-on-the-town.\n\nThe architecture of Copley Square is also a popular tourist site. The styles in this square range from the Gothic Revival of the Old South Church to the modern Hancock Tower, a glass skyscraper office building. \n\nExperience the highlights of Boston and Cambridge in this fascinating half- or full-day tour.", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "", "booking_notes": "#We look forward to you joining us! \nYour guide is Naim Benmayor and their phone number is 617-306-4877. Please reach out with any questions. Naim will be in touch soon to set up the meeting place and any custom changes to the tour.", "cancellation_notes": "", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "For all ages! • 3 & 7 hour options • Starting at $600", "short_description": null, "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/bostonprivateguide/items/448075/images/926316/", "pk": 926316, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/FR05B283QM6UJjZkYiWS", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/FR05B283QM6UJjZkYiWS", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/bostonprivateguide/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/bostonprivateguide/items/448075/"}, "crop": {}, "cropped_url": 